-- title:
--   Cached Mellin jet correlations for panels 8–11
-- statement:
--   This table stores proposed integers $B_{i,m}$ for panel indices $8\le i\le11$ and correlation indices $0\le m<184$. Each row is intended to represent the finite integer correlation of the published theta-jet coefficients with the integration weights.
--
--   $$
--   (B_{i,0},\ldots,B_{i,183}).
--   $$
--
--   The data can be reused for all moment orders. This definition alone asserts no correctness or numerical moment bound.
-- source:
--   Exact integer data generated from the theta-jet coefficients of sometik179, Prove2Me c9908072-d99a-4431-aad8-a72c6352619a, https://prove2.me/submissions/c9908072-d99a-4431-aad8-a72c6352619a; theta/Mellin foundations by Gabewhigham. The values require separate kernel verification.

